---
// Mini Preview: toast（轻提示）-- 纯静态，零 JS，Gallery/Stream 用
---
<div class="w-full aspect-[16/9] bg-canvas border border-line rounded-card overflow-hidden p-4 relative">
  <div class="absolute inset-4 card-surface rounded-control p-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
    <span class="text-[11px] text-muted">触发操作后短暂出现…</span>
    <span class="btn btn--primary rounded-control px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px]">复制 Prompt</span>
  </div>
  <!-- Toast -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-8 inset-x-0 flex justify-center">
    <div class="bg-dark-bg text-white text-[10px] px-3.5 py-2 rounded-pill shadow-card flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="text-secondary">✓</span>
      已复制到剪贴板
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="absolute bottom-2 inset-x-0 text-center text-[9px] text-muted">非阻断反馈，自动消失</p>
</div>